==Depictions==
Andrew was portrayed by [[Rufus Sewell]] in the 2024 [[Netflix]] drama film ''[[Scoop (2024 film)|Scoop]]'', which depicts the 2019 BBC ''Newsnight'' interview "[[Prince Andrew & the Epstein Scandal]]".<ref>{{Cite news |date=5 April 2024 |title=Scoop: Prince Andrew's infamous BBC interview... as dramatised by Netflix |url=https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/uk-68739026 |access-date=31 October 2025 |work=[[BBC News Online|BBC News]] |language=en-GB |archive-date=26 November 2025 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20251126235911/https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/uk-68739026 |url-status=live }}</ref> He was portrayed by [[Michael Sheen]] in the 2024 three-part [[Amazon MGM Studios]] drama series ''[[A Very Royal Scandal]],'' which also centres on the interview.<ref>{{Cite news|date=14 August 2024 |title=First images of Michael Sheen as Prince Andrew in A Very Royal Scandal |url=https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/clyn3g7zvkko |access-date=31 October 2025 |website=[[BBC News Online|BBC News]] |language=en-GB |archive-date=26 September 2025 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20250926182302/https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/clyn3g7zvkko |url-status=live }}</ref> Andrew was portrayed by Tom Byrne in the fourth season, and by [[James Murray (English actor)|James Murray]] in the final two seasons, of Netflix's ''[[The Crown (TV series)|The Crown]]''.<ref>{{cite news|url=https://variety.com/2022/tv/global/the-crown-james-murray-prince-andrew-1235430520/ |title='The Crown's' James Murray on Playing Disgraced Prince Andrew: 'I Enjoy Polarizing Roles' |website=[[Variety (magazine)|Variety]] |last=Yossman |first=K. J. |date=11 November 2022 |access-date=18 November 2023 |archive-date=19 December 2025 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20251219142849/https://variety.com/2022/tv/global/the-crown-james-murray-prince-andrew-1235430520/ |url-status=live }}</ref><ref>{{cite news|title=The Crown newcomer Tom Byrne showed his potential in early am-dram days in Haverhill|url=https://www.suffolknews.co.uk/haverhill/news/the-crown-actor-had-star-quality-as-a-youngster-9102319/|website=Suffolk News|archive-date=11 August 2020|access-date=3 November 2025|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20200811000604/https://www.suffolknews.co.uk/haverhill/news/the-crown-actor-had-star-quality-as-a-youngster-9102319/|url-status=live}}</ref>

